abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 and mathlib formalization classifying the 25 ordered hyperbolic
  cosine triples for which the discriminant is negative at every
  nonidentity real embedding of the full cosine field. Includes commented
  proofs, exact kernel-checked finite certificates, and introductory lessons.
  Developed with substantial OpenAI Codex assistance, disclosed in the
  provenance documentation. The current scope is the cosine-triple
  classification; a theory of topographs is not yet formalized.
  Software is licensed under Apache 2.0; standalone documentation is
  licensed under CC BY 4.0.
